(7481329, 1190210, 124815, '<td valign="top">This is more a Tiffany approach and hardly a photograph anymore.</td>', 'This is more a Tiffany approach and hardly a photograph anymore.', '2016-11-07 08:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7481330, 1190244, 124815, '<td valign="top">Very sweet, as sweet as the impressionists outlook on nature. The problem is it''s too.....likeable. well done technically, certainly superior to most images here who used filters ad nauseam. Well done</td>', 'Very sweet, as sweet as the impressionists outlook on nature. The problem is it''s too.....likeable. well done technically, certainly superior to most images here who used filters ad nauseam. Well done', '2016-11-07 08:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7481331, 1190253, 124815, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. Less use of the filter would have been even better imv. Nice</td>', 'Nice subject. Less use of the filter would have been even better imv. Nice', '2016-11-07 08:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7481332, 1190207, 124815, '<td valign="top">Nice understanding of the challenge. Reminds me of a forerunner, of Courbet. Well done</td>', 'Nice understanding of the challenge. Reminds me of a forerunner, of Courbet. Well done', '2016-11-07 08:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7481333, 1190228, 124815, '<td valign="top">Here less would have been more. Just the flowers remind of a Fantin Latour for instance. I do not think that for the impressionists the subject of a still life was of such mportance. A vase with flowers or a few apples in a proper light would have been enough. <br/>As a still life photo I find the filter too much. With a standard editting would be so much nicer</td>', 'Here less would have been more. Just the flowers remind of a Fantin Latour for instance. I do not think that for the impressionists the subject of a still life was of such mportance. A vase with flowers or a few apples in a proper light would have been enough. As a still life photo I find the filter too much. With a standard editting would be so much nicer', '2016-11-07 08:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7481334, 1190226, 124815, '<td valign="top">Nice sketch</td>', 'Nice sketch', '2016-11-07 08:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
